1550
01:06:20,147 --> 01:06:21,148
-Okay.
-No problem.

1551
01:06:21,215 --> 01:06:22,449
-Thank you.
-Yeah.

1552
01:06:23,852 --> 01:06:25,052
-It's beautiful.
