-Yeah.

1683
01:12:47,602 --> 01:12:51,305
-[camera mechanism whirs]
-[soft beat music]

1684
01:12:51,371 --> 01:12:53,341
-You got this.
-Grip, step, step.

1685
01:12:53,406 --> 01:12:54,876
Grip, step, step.

1686
01:12:54,942 --> 01:12:56,043
Grip, step, step.

1687
01:12:56,110 --> 01:12:58,646
Grip, step, step.

1688
01:12:58,713 --> 01:13:00,047
Yes.

1689
01:13:00,114 --> 01:13:01,282
[Leah shrieks]

1690
01:13:01,349 --> 01:13:04,451
-Okay, okay.
-Grip, step, step.

1691
01:13:04,518 --> 01:13:05,887
Yeah.

1692
01:13:05,953 --> 01:13:08,923
-Let's go, let's go, yeah!
-[all applaud]

1693
01:13:08,990 --> 01:13:11,893
-[Leah laughs]
-[all cheer and applaud]

1694
01:13:11,959 --> 01:13:13,861
[Bianca laughs]

1695
01:13:13,928 --> 01:13:15,263
Oh my gosh.

1696
01:13:15,329 --> 01:13:16,463
[all cheer and applaud]

1697
01:13:16,530 --> 01:13:19,267
Oh, wow, I'm so high.

1698
01:13:19,333 --> 01:13:20,801
I'm so high.

1699
01:13:21,535 --> 01:13:23,537
