What do I, wait, what do I do?

1701
01:13:24,906 --> 01:13:26,240
-Slide down.
-Okay, okay.

1702
01:13:26,307 --> 01:13:27,541
Just slide down.

1703
01:13:27,608 --> 01:13:28,643
-Okay.
-Yeah.

1704
01:13:28,709 --> 01:13:29,944
-Yes.
-Just what?

1705
01:13:30,011 --> 01:13:31,679
Fall down?

1706
