helping out as well.

1762
01:16:09,804 --> 01:16:11,605
Very kind. Um...

1763
01:16:11,672 --> 01:16:13,074
If you could just
give this to her.

1764
01:16:13,140 --> 01:16:14,608
That'd be great.

1765
01:16:14,675 --> 01:16:16,610
