I came by, that'd be great.

1769
01:16:22,583 --> 01:16:23,851
Mason.

1770
01:16:26,053 --> 01:16:28,856
-Big dog.
-Yeah, that's me.

1771
01:16:28,923 --> 01:16:30,357
-All right.
-Yeah.

1772
01:16:30,424 --> 01:16:31,959
-Later.
-Later.

1773
01:16:33,394 --> 01:16:36,730
